Security triage and bug scrub follow-up

The issue contains indicators of a potential security defect. Please confirm that the Suspected Security Defect field and the approved security-defect workflow are being used.

The current record also needs the following durable information before the Done/Fixed outcome can be confirmed:

- identify the owning Component or link every component-owned child bug for the affected skills;
- add the scanner version, tested revisions, required configuration, numbered reproduction steps, expected result, and exact redacted observed result or report reference;
- state reproduction frequency, regression status, affected and unaffected scope, and workaround or explicitly state that none is known;
- document the impact, scope, and workaround evidence supporting P1 without relying only on scanner severity;
- reconcile the ten-skill Description with the implementing PRs and explain the earlier reopen from Invalid;
- add post-fix verification for the complete retained scope, including retest environment, tested build or commit, rerun steps, result, and verifier or automated test reference.

Please keep durable reproduction and closure evidence in the Description rather than only in comments. Do not add credentials, secrets, personal data, exploit details, or other sensitive material to this general Jira issue; use the approved security channel for sensitive evidence.
